# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Web3Forms — powers the contact form (src/components/sections/Contact.jsx)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Create a free access key at https://web3forms.com (just enter the email
#    address you want the messages delivered to).
# 2. Copy this file to `.env.local` and paste the key below.
# 3. Restart the dev server. For production add the same variable in the
#    Vercel dashboard (Project → Settings → Environment Variables) and
#    redeploy — Vite inlines VITE_* variables at build time.
#
# The key is safe to expose in the browser: it can only deliver mail to the
# inbox you registered it with.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=your-access-key-here
